WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:06.240
At one time, gods and demons were as one.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.200
They were sealed away in the abyss of distant memory.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.100
The hearts of humans in fear of the Dark caused this.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.460
For the present, let us call these beings "Shinma".

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.460
<i>Shinma: Japanese for “Gods-Demons”</i>

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.830
Now they've awakened and gathered in the Dark.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:29.670
The final night of the gathering, when Shinma and humans met again,

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.510
a young girl entered their midst. This is her story. Her name is...

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:43.850
Vampire Princess Miyu

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.770
I need... your help...

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:30.690
Hirano's

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:42.000
You want me to help you?

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.540
Please, Himiko.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:18.150
Without him, I... I...

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.110
Very well. But on one condition.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:30.000
If I save him, tell me about the two of you... and the Shinma.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:33.920
What will you do with that knowledge?

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:40.010
I... I just want to know, that's all!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:44.970
Episode 3
Fragile Armour

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:04.660
Miyu!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.580
I'm counting on you, Himiko!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.500
What?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.850
Miyu! The girl who hunts Shinma!

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:32.770
Hunt me, if you dare! After all, I'm Shinma!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.590
No!

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.690
What do you mean, "no"?

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:41.470
I'm sorry... I can't engage him.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:42.610
You cannot mean that!

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:48.540
Hunt me down, Miyu! Kill me... if you can!

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.380
Guess it won't work like it does in the comics!

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.140
I'm impressed.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:47.510
Take me to him.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.510
Okay!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.100
I know witches can be troublesome...

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.530
But still, that was pathetic. She was only a human, after all.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.450
I am Shinma! Next time for sure!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.080
Larva is...

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:40.270
He's my sole servant... and friend.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:44.140
I have heard that before.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.200
What do you want to know?

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:50.620
Where did you come from? And...

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.820
Where are we going?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.630
I don't know such things.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:43.820
Good, that's the spirit.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:46.810
Why do you make me do these things?

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:50.630
I am Shinma. What could link me to a human house?

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.240
Oh, nothing at all, really...

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:00.230
I just wanted to test your power.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:12.540
Night's ocean is frightening, as if it would pull you in...

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:22.370
I was listening to the sound of the ocean, when Larva appeared.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.590
When was that?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.000
I don't remember...

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.730
<i>There’s nothing to be afraid of.</i>

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:40.120
<i>There’s nothing to be afraid of.</i>

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.500
<i>Nothing to be afraid of.</i>

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.910
<i>I just want to borrow a <i>little bit of your life.</i></i>

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:08.170
<i>That’s a good girl.</i>

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:26.020
<i>I travelled far across the ocean... to be leader of your people.</i>

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:28.440
<i>Leader?</i>

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:33.360
<i>Yes... of the Shinma.</i>

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:38.780
<i>Shinma? I don’t know about any Shinma.</i>

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.640
<i>Your body should remember...</i>

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:47.170
<i>that we crossed the ocean in a similar way, long ago...</i>

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:52.210
<i>and that time, I granted a certain power...</i>

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.130
<i>to a person with the same blood as yours.</i>

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:58.710
<i>My blood?</i>

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.820
<i>Hold still...</i>

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.820
<i>What... what is this?!</i>

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.200
<i>Miyu!</i>

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.490
<i>Give me... blood.</i>

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:38.580
That was when I awakened to my vampire blood...

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:09.350
Larva could not kill me, so, as punishment...

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.380
his voice and face were sealed away...

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.140
and he became my servant.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:22.040
My only servant...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:30.400
Only he helps me and can understand my feelings...

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.860
He's... important to me.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.980
Please, Himiko, save Larva...

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.780
Can't you defeat that thing?

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.200
Not me, no.

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:50.500
Anyway, this should keep anyone other than us away from him.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.550
And, since the "darani" was effective, it may be of use here also.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.550
<i>Darani: Himiko’s earlier incantation. The collected secret teachings of the Buddha.</i>

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.090
As for saving him...

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.580
That...

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.560
...looks familiar, don't you think?

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:26.910
<i>Actually, I don’t know why I helped the demon child,</i>

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:31.990
<i>but I went all over Kyoto, per Miyu’s instructions...</i>

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:35.410
<i>and did not feel irritated. Why?</i>

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.610
<i>Maybe I'm beginning to feel that the little demon is...</i>

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.260
<i>No way...</i>

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:46.640
<i>The armour in the photo had changed hands often...</i>

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:52.190
<i>and wound up as a part of an ordinary couple’s inheritance.</i>

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:57.110
<i>The monster that attacked us didn’t appear again.</i>

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:01.110
<i>That left me with only the search for the armour.</i>

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.090
May I help you? Have you an interest in this house?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.300
No, nothing... Was there a fire here?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:28.220
It looks like arson. Luckily, though, the house was empty.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:39.430
Couple? Oh, yes, they lived here, until a month ago,

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:44.050
when they died. Suicide.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.030
Suicide?

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:51.050
It was terrible. The husband died after a long illness...

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:52.960
and the wife followed soon after.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:57.880
I was wondering if you found a suit of armour in the ruins...

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:01.740
Armour? No, nothing like that.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.660
Well, thank you anyway.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:32.540
Are you looking for this?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:54.220
Excuse me, but wasn't it moved from here?

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:58.190
What interest do you have in it?

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.520
Well, actually, it's for my grad school research paper...

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.360
Perhaps, a girl had asked you to do this?

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:09.780
A girl?

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:15.870
Well, Ms. Spiritualist?

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:37.590
Lady, you must stop these bothersome activities.

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.570
Die!

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.040
Miyu!

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:03.340
So you've finally shown yourself.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.250
Vampire!

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:11.650
You can't run or hide any more, Shinma Lemures.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:23.690
Shinma... Lemures? Miyu, you used me as bait!?

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:41.960
Release the seal on Larva, Shinma Lemures.

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:46.380
Nonsense! You think you're leader of the Shinma?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:50.980
Target me, not Larva, if you want to kill me and control the Shinma!

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:55.900
Control the Shinma? I'm not interested in that.

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:59.560
I just want to free Larva from your control.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:03.480
You knew Larva?

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:11.190
I am Larva's friend... no, much more than that!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:14.320
I drank his blood! He is mine!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:19.740
But you can't defeat this!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:38.030
Try to kill me, Shinma hunter!

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:40.270
Stop this! Try to remember!

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:43.800
Remember?

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:51.610
Yes, who you are, why you're here,
that you were human...

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:55.530
Me? A human? Ridiculous.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:58.830
See for yourself.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:43.580
This can't be happening! What are you doing?!

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:47.500
Lemures, I'll only say this once more.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.920
Release Larva!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:56.550
You will die, vampire!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:13.650
I won't return you to the Dark. You, I'll reduce to ashes.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:37.300
Larva! You're under this girl's spell!

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:42.220
Lemures, don't you understand?

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.140
Understand what?

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:51.350
This girl's... sorrow.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:11.330
I know, I know now, hunter.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.490
Let go of me!

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.910
I... I am Shinma!

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:20.300
A stray Shinma... and so, you must destroy me.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:25.220
No! You're a human. That's why I...

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.360
Don't say that!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.080
Larva, the seal's been broken!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.000
Oh, wonderful!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.560
Larva, don't worry about him.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:09.560
Remember! You were a man,
body ravaged by disease, strength gone;

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.190
who died, leaving a beloved wife.

00:20:13.090 --> 00:20:16.410
I know of no such thing!

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:21.480
You must remember! You died and were reborn,

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:25.030
with your soul sealed in a vessel – that armour,

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.060
through the Shinma magic of Lemuria,

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.810
black magic which manipulates human life and death.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:33.960
Thus your soul remains after your flesh has fallen apart!

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:37.720
I know nothing about this!

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:43.030
I know nothing!

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:49.510
Larva!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.920
I am... Shinma!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.900
You are human.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.980
Therefore, you shall be judged by human law.

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.770
He will be judged by humans.

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:22.690
He wanted to forget his death and resurrection by Shinma.

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:44.170
I see now... I am... I am...!

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:48.670
Lemurian magic requires the body of the dead...

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:52.650
and another, fresh, life.

00:22:56.000 --> 00:23:02.660
His wife sacrificed herself to bring him back to life.

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:07.450
He wanted to forget that...

00:23:07.450 --> 00:23:10.320
so he convinced himself that he was Shinma, not human.

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:13.310
I'm...

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:18.160
I'm human! Don't shoot! I'm...

00:23:18.470 --> 00:23:20.620
I'm human!

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:48.070
So long, Himiko.

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:55.440
Why? Why not let him die as he wanted... as a Shinma?

00:23:56.680 --> 00:23:59.490
Humans have many things that they want to forget...

00:23:59.490 --> 00:24:03.160
even things they'd sooner die than remember!

00:24:03.490 --> 00:24:05.670
Will forgetting solve anything?

00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:08.530
I can't excuse those people...

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:12.590
who forget sadness, love, or hate...

00:24:16.070 --> 00:24:18.510
Because I will never forget.

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:27.110
Miyu! You...
